        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">The Engineering Foundation</h2>
        <p>
          I hold a <strong>B.Sc. in Computer Science</strong> from the <strong>University of Calicut</strong>. While traditional marketing often operates on surface intuition, my computer science background provides an engineering foundation: I understand DOM manipulation, rendering lifecycles, structured data parsing, and algorithmic behavior.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Career Journey & Early Internship</h2>
        <p>
          My digital marketing path started with an intensive internship at <strong>Softroniics</strong> in Calicut. There, I was immersed in the mechanics of commercial keyword research, on-page optimization, search engine audit methodology, and ad-copy experimentation. That experience crystallized my approach: marketing is an applied science where data precision directly impacts revenue.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Current Role: Digitz Technologies (UAE)</h2>
        <p>
          Currently, I drive digital marketing and search campaigns for clients at <strong>Digitz Technologies LLC</strong>, a premier UAE-based digital agency. In this role, I manage full-funnel digital marketing across key commercial verticals, including e-commerce, commercial safety systems, enterprise security, and international logistics. My daily responsibilities center on structuring Google Ads search campaigns, setting up end-to-end attribution (GA4, GTM, Meta Pixel), and executing technical SEO overhauls.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Personal Statement: &ldquo;Somehow, This Is My Profession.&rdquo;</h2>
        <p>
          Many people enter digital marketing by accident; I embraced it deliberately because it is where technical precision meets real-world human intent. Every keyword search is a live query into what a consumer or business genuinely needs at that second.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          For freelance clients, I offer a clear, transparent engagement model: no vanity metrics, no fluff reports. I audit your digital footprint, identify where potential customers or ad dollars are being lost, and execute high-precision organic and paid campaigns.
        </p>
      </section>
